on its own. That gives roughly 50 short units of product 1 and roughly 30 of product 0 in total. Spoilage almost never kicks in. Adding a +10% safety margin on top of this makes stock grow every day: holding and write-offs cost more than the shortages it prevents (net about −700).\n\n4. **Candidates.**\n   - **Candidate 3** is the only plan that orders right at the mean: about 1.05 × forecast for both products.\n   - The other daily plans add more: candidate 6 orders about 1.15×, candidate 2 about 1.2×, candidate 4 about 1.3×.\n   - The every-second-day plans add 9–20% over the mean: candidates 5, 7 and 1.\n   - Candidate 0 (every 3 days) adds about 10% and also loses stock to the warehouse limit.\n\n   Capacity is not a problem for candidate 3: its buffers plus daily arrivals stay well under 268."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3687, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3687}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-27T15:05:55.393Z", "request_id": "req_011CgSwmw6pxxqzPm22QNLe3"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_019GrjqEYboF61Di46Psr6i6", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgSwmwTufVEfyG5o8uxeC", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_019GrjqEYboF61Di46Psr6i6", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"choice"